  "description": "Go Seung-il used to have it all. Seriously, he was on top of the world. That is, until he was betrayed by someone he trusted, sending his once-thriving life spiraling straight into rock bottom.\n\nTo make matters worse, he gets into a car accident with a foreign luxury car belonging to a former classmate he used to bully in high school. With not even a penny to his name for a settlement, Seung-il is desperate. That's when his old classmate, Won Woo-jin, makes him an offer: *“I have a puppy I've been raising. I want you to take over training him for me.”*\n\nWait... that “puppy” is actually a human?! The classmate he reunited with after all these years has come back as a total pervert.\n\n*“Of course, I'll pay you for your trouble.”*\n\nLeft with no choice, Seung-il ends up accepting the pervert’s—no, Woo-jin’s—offer. *(Source: Bomtoon, translated)*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Reverse_entry)",
